'''Pyreball seal''' is a fire-type spell used to create a levitating ball of flame.

==Description==
Pyreball seal is a spell that contains a central fire sigil with [[Signs Explained#Levitation|levitation]] keystones arranged around it.{{Ref|m|8|10}} This spell produces a ball of fire that will levitate both itself and any object that isn't too heavy directly above the glyph.{{Ref|m|8|10}}

==Usage==
This spell was used during [[chapter 8]] by [[Coco]] under the instruction of [[Qifrey]] to cook [[Carapace Yam|carapace yams]]{{Ref|m|8|10}} for a picnic.{{Ref|m|8|16}}<gallery>
File:Pyreball seal usage.png|The first time we see the pyreball seal being used.
</gallery>

